      "title": {
        "en": "Attentive and caring veterinary staff"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Clients frequently praise the veterinary team and technicians for their compassionate approach and willingness to listen to owner concerns. Practitioners like Dr. Molly and Dr. Vega receive warm remarks for thorough guidance during stressful visits. A few reviewers, however, felt staff were less helpful with exotic pet care."
      }
    },
    {
      "topic": "results",
      "sentiment": "mixed",
      "mentions": 9,
      "title": {
        "en": "Reliable canine care alongside exotic concerns"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Pet owners report successful treatments for complex conditions, including diaphragmatic hernia repair, heartworm therapy, and acupuncture. Dogs and cats frequently recover well under clinic treatment plans. Conversely, owners of exotic pets reported disappointing outcomes, including an untreated tortoise and a misdiagnosed rabbit."
      }
    },
    {
      "topic": "animals",
      "sentiment": "positive",
      "mentions": 5,
      "title": {
        "en": "Gentle handling for anxious pets"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Reviewers emphasize how comfortably pets are handled during procedures, examinations, and routine nail trims. Multiple owners note that staff use calming techniques and light sedation when needed to keep fearful dogs and cats relaxed throughout their appointments. Animals are treated with genuine patience and affection."
      }
    }
  ],
